WEBVTT

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:07.453
Leave a screen, and Telo Ride gives its memory back. Now there's a check that proves

00:00:07.453 --> 00:00:07.927
it.

00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:15.038
Each check forces a garbage collection, then reads the heap, through the DevTools

00:00:15.038 --> 00:00:15.862
protocol.

00:00:23.228 --> 00:00:28.753
The race and its 3D world, in and out six times. After the first round, the heap may

00:00:28.753 --> 00:00:30.894
grow five megabytes at most.

00:00:36.133 --> 00:00:40.698
A class ride gets the same six rounds, and a three-hour class may grow fifty

00:00:40.698 --> 00:00:42.079
megabytes at most.

00:00:49.038 --> 00:00:53.297
The class ride these checks enter and leave, from a phone to the full screen.

00:00:59.361 --> 00:01:04.026
They run only when a person asks: never in verify, never in CI.

00:01:09.685 --> 00:01:14.288
Telo Ride, from the Telo family, turns a smart bike at home into a game.

00:01:14.633 --> 00:01:19.145
It pairs with the bike over Bluetooth, reads your power and sets resistance for

00:01:19.145 --> 00:01:20.816
every hill and interval.

00:01:21.161 --> 00:01:26.339
Two doors: Race (ride a map against your best-time ghost, bots or people) and

00:01:26.339 --> 00:01:31.787
Classes (ride along to a video, alone or with a group), fed by one progression of

00:01:31.787 --> 00:01:34.777
XP, rider levels, stars and map unlocks.

00:01:35.123 --> 00:01:37.615
A custom workout lives under Profile.
